##### Tibble helper

```{r}
tibblehelper <- function(rawinput){
  a <- fromJSON(rawToChar(rawinput$content))
  as.data.frame(a[-1, , drop = FALSE], stringsAsFactors = FALSE) |>
    setNames(a[1, ]) |>
    as_tibble()
}
```

